instructions:
  - "Chop green chilies."
  - "Add oil, chopped spinach, and other ingredients into wheat flour and make a dough."
  - "Cover dough with a wet cloth and keep it aside for 30 minutes."
  - "Divide the dough into 6 equal balls, roll it, and place on a hot tawa."
  - "Cook until slightly cooked, then flip and wait until brown marks appear."
  - "Apply some oil, turn, and shallow-fry from both sides."
